+# Rentals
+
+Contents: 1. Rental periods as a Duration
+
+## 1. Rental periods as a Duration
+
+Hold every rental period, every extension and every limit on them as a Duration, and name it for what it limits, such as STANDARD_RENTAL_PERIOD. A bare number leaves the unit to the reader, and the shop rents by the hour in summer and by the day in winter.
+
+- Limits: a number of hours that a rider sends to the web entry arrives as a number, and the entry turns it into a Duration.
