@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+---
+paths:
+  - "**/src/test/java/**/*.java"
+---
+# Tests
+
+Contents: 1. Beans of a test by field injection
+
+## 1. Beans of a test by field injection
+
+Inject each bean that a test class uses into a private field with the Autowired marker, and write no constructor in a test class. Every test class of the project takes its beans the same way, so a reader finds them at the top of each class, and the framework creates each test class itself.
+
+- Limits: production code takes every dependency through its constructor.
